			"updated": 1795739608536,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "How to read this column: start from a real system (EventPulse Stage 1), watch it break,\nlist what we actually need, try the simpler fixes one by one, and only then meet\nthe idea Kafka is built on. Every step is a trade-off, not a verdict.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "Cr3MCLlrqsCpSCZ7DdfHA",
