			"updated": 1795739608536,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "With a buffer the burst is stored, then drained at the\ndatabase's own pace when traffic drops. The price:\nextra delay, and the buffer must be big and durable.",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "SrpsOAyltLOcMzKA57r82",
			"originalText": "With a buffer the burst is stored, then drained at the\ndatabase's own pace when traffic drops. The price:\nextra delay, and the buffer must be big and durable.",
