			"updated": 1795739608536,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "How: after receiving an event, the sender calls each\ninterested service over HTTP, with retries, without\nwaiting for the answer.",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "g2CorUaVN0Sp2eJZArWjQ",
			"originalText": "How: after receiving an event, the sender calls each\ninterested service over HTTP, with retries, without\nwaiting for the answer.",
