			"updated": 1795739608536,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Cons: a message is gone once acked,\nso no replay and no history for new\nreaders; one queue per reader to fan\nout; order lost with parallel consumers;\nper-queue throughput limit",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "hxrpgrrNUZLB7jdc8axQF",
			"originalText": "Cons: a message is gone once acked,\nso no replay and no history for new\nreaders; one queue per reader to fan\nout; order lost with parallel consumers;\nper-queue throughput limit",
			"autoResize": true,
