			"updated": 1795739608537,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Each message goes to ONE\nconsumer. After the ack the\nbroker deletes it. Great for\ntask distribution; nobody can\nre-read it and a new reader\ncannot see the past.",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "dLQwwkp3oGUfTkP7YFeot",
			"originalText": "Each message goes to ONE\nconsumer. After the ack the\nbroker deletes it. Great for\ntask distribution; nobody can\nre-read it and a new reader\ncannot see the past.",
