			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Every need on the checklist maps to one idea: an append-only log, split into partitions,\ncopied across brokers, with offsets owned by the readers. The main column on the right\ntakes each of these mechanisms apart, one chapter at a time.",
