			"updated": 1795739608537,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Tools combine\n\nThe options are not enemies. A DB outbox can\npublish into Kafka, keeping 'save + publish'\natomic, and a job queue can sit after Kafka\nfor retries of individual tasks.",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "2ecdn63bPCKElIv_S-uhE",
			"originalText": "Tools combine\n\nThe options are not enemies. A DB outbox can\npublish into Kafka, keeping 'save + publish'\natomic, and a job queue can sit after Kafka\nfor retries of individual tasks.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": 1795406001446,
