			"updated": 1795739525642,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Why auto.create.topics.enable=false: a mistyped name (event.raw) would silently create a\n1-partition topic with default settings and events would vanish. With it off, the send fails loudly.",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "tn1",
			"originalText": "Why auto.create.topics.enable=false: a mistyped name (event.raw) would silently create a\n1-partition topic with default settings and events would vanish. With it off, the send fails loudly.",
