			"updated": 1795739525643,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "producerId + baseSequence: the idempotent producer's\nduplicate detection. The broker drops a retried batch\n(KAFKA_IDEMPOTENT=true costs almost nothing).",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "bn2",
			"originalText": "producerId + baseSequence: the idempotent producer's\nduplicate detection. The broker drops a retried batch\n(KAFKA_IDEMPOTENT=true costs almost nothing).",
