			"text": "/var/lib/kafka/data/\n  events.raw-0/  <- a partition\n  events.raw-1/\n  ...\n  events.dlq-0/\n  __consumer_offsets-0..49/\n  __cluster_metadata-0/\n(one dir per replica: topic-partition)",
