			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795739525644,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Why segments exist\nDeleting from the middle of a giant file is\nimpossible; deleting a whole file is instant\n1 Retention: drop the oldest whole file\n2 Lookup: pick file by name, search inside\n3 Bounded recovery and compaction work",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "why",
			"originalText": "Why segments exist\nDeleting from the middle of a giant file is\nimpossible; deleting a whole file is instant\n1 Retention: drop the oldest whole file\n2 Lookup: pick file by name, search inside\n3 Bounded recovery and compaction work",
