			"updated": 1795739525644,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "It's a minimum gap, not a fixed rule. Kafka adds an\nindex entry only after at least 4096 bytes of new\ndata have been written since the last entry. The\nsetting is index.interval.bytes.",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "GhCbyRohtynuVc4A01-zS",
			"originalText": "It's a minimum gap, not a fixed rule. Kafka adds an\nindex entry only after at least 4096 bytes of new\ndata have been written since the last entry. The\nsetting is index.interval.bytes.",
