			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795739525653,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Replication is per partition, not per topic or per broker: one broker failing triggers an independent\nleader election for each partition it led. That is why partition count affects failover time, and why\nin Step 5 one broker down is a brief blip but two of three down gives NOT_ENOUGH_REPLICAS and 503s.",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "gf",
			"originalText": "Replication is per partition, not per topic or per broker: one broker failing triggers an independent\nleader election for each partition it led. That is why partition count affects failover time, and why\nin Step 5 one broker down is a brief blip but two of three down gives NOT_ENOUGH_REPLICAS and 503s.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
