			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Idempotence covers the\nlibrary's retries only,\nwithin one producer\nsession. An HTTP client\nretry must reuse the\nsame event_id; the sink\nuses ON CONFLICT\n(event_id).",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "VN6xG6afYelsDzbi76PPb",
			"originalText": "Idempotence covers the\nlibrary's retries only,\nwithin one producer\nsession. An HTTP client\nretry must reuse the\nsame event_id; the sink\nuses ON CONFLICT\n(event_id).",
