			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Step 5 test rules\n- assert 503 + kafka_unavailable, never 202\n- assert nothing appended (end offsets same)\n- do not assert NOT_ENOUGH_REPLICAS (timeout)\n- docker kill ~9 s, docker stop ~3-5 s\n- wait for ISR = 3 between tests",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 5,
