			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795739525664,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "• What is elected: the leader of one partition, among its\nreplicas\n• Mechanism: the active controller picks, from the ISR\n• Scope: one per partition (6 for events.raw, 50 for\n__consumer_offsets)\n• Needs: a working active controller\n• See it with: kafka-topics.sh --describe (Leader)",
			"originalText": "• What is elected: the leader of one partition, among its\nreplicas\n• Mechanism: the active controller picks, from the ISR\n• Scope: one per partition (6 for events.raw, 50 for\n__consumer_offsets)\n• Needs: a working active controller\n• See it with: kafka-topics.sh --describe (Leader)",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
