			"text": "If a majority of voters is gone (2 of 3): NO controller can be elected, so NO partition leader can be elected and the\nISR cannot change. [observed, note 3, Lab 7: acks=all timed out, admin tools hung, acks=1 still worked against the\nsurviving leader]",
