			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Rolling restart rule: stop ONE broker at a time and wait\nuntil --under-replicated-partitions is empty. Otherwise the\nISR can drop below min.insync.replicas and writes stop.",
			"originalText": "Rolling restart rule: stop ONE broker at a time and wait\nuntil --under-replicated-partitions is empty. Otherwise the\nISR can drop below min.insync.replicas and writes stop.",
