			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795739525665,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "OBSERVED [note 3, Lab 6]  Partition replicas 1,2,3, leader 1. After docker stop ep-kafka1:\n• Leader became broker 2 with Isr 2,3, visible about 17 s after the stop command was issued\n• acks=all writes via broker 2 succeeded\n• Broker 2's leader-epoch-checkpoint gained: epoch 1 starts at offset 15, exactly the end of the old leader's log\n• After restart: ISR 1,2,3 in about 12 s, leader still broker 2, identical log size, offsetLag 0",
			"originalText": "OBSERVED [note 3, Lab 6]  Partition replicas 1,2,3, leader 1. After docker stop ep-kafka1:\n• Leader became broker 2 with Isr 2,3, visible about 17 s after the stop command was issued\n• acks=all writes via broker 2 succeeded\n• Broker 2's leader-epoch-checkpoint gained: epoch 1 starts at offset 15, exactly the end of the old leader's log\n• After restart: ISR 1,2,3 in about 12 s, leader still broker 2, identical log size, offsetLag 0",
			"fontSize": 19,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "PsDuoxgh1tjKOxNv4A2Sp",
