			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Not for records never acknowledged: appended on the old\nleader but not replicated, they may vanish. The producer's\nretry covers them.",
			"originalText": "Not for records never acknowledged: appended on the old\nleader but not replicated, they may vanish. The producer's\nretry covers them.",
