		{
			"id": "EDmsT4BU",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 12013.035755966415,
			"y": 3038.85937487848,
			"width": 583.5922241210938,
			"height": 225,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [
				"SWVpMm-l29RHxflmwHbRL"
			],
			"frameId": null,
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1862657439,
			"version": 429,
			"versionNonce": 1107790401,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795739525667,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "• Errors are retriable and retried inside the client library until\nthe delivery timeout.\n• Failover shorter than the timeout: invisible, just extra latency\non that request.\n• Longer than the timeout: the caller sees a send timeout.\n• Idempotence: the new leader knows which sequences it has seen,\nso a replicated-but-unacknowledged batch is detected as a\nduplicate.\n• A batch appended on the old leader but never replicated is\ngone; its retry appends it fresh.",
			"originalText": "• Errors are retriable and retried inside the client library until\nthe delivery timeout.\n• Failover shorter than the timeout: invisible, just extra latency\non that request.\n• Longer than the timeout: the caller sees a send timeout.\n• Idempotence: the new leader knows which sequences it has seen,\nso a replicated-but-unacknowledged batch is detected as a\nduplicate.\n• A batch appended on the old leader but never replicated is\ngone; its retry appends it fresh.",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "ybOiccYwJTV6bx3Uiy_6b",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"index": "c0dN9V",
			"created": 1795576972589,
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
