		{
			"id": "5jftH5X8",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 12653.035755966415,
			"y": 4103.85937487848,
			"width": 553.1363525390625,
			"height": 180,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [
				"SWVpMm-l29RHxflmwHbRL"
			],
			"frameId": null,
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 561782207,
			"version": 428,
			"versionNonce": 1524375457,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795739525668,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "• A preferred election is a CLEAN election: leadership only\nmoves to an ISR replica that is caught up.\n• It costs a brief blip (another epoch), so it is not free on a\nbusy partition.\n• [observed, Lab 6] epoch went 1 to 2 and no acknowledged\nrecord was lost.\n• After a failover one broker can lead many partitions; this\nspreads the load again.",
			"originalText": "• A preferred election is a CLEAN election: leadership only\nmoves to an ISR replica that is caught up.\n• It costs a brief blip (another epoch), so it is not free on a\nbusy partition.\n• [observed, Lab 6] epoch went 1 to 2 and no acknowledged\nrecord was lost.\n• After a failover one broker can lead many partitions; this\nspreads the load again.",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "lLbBVhGpUL2uvQtVlWzbh",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"index": "c0dNL",
			"created": 1795576972589,
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "NR5mInn6XtdZqP8Q4qWC9",
