			"updated": 1795739525668,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "• The partition stays OFFLINE until an ISR member (here B)\ncomes back.\n• Reads and writes fail meanwhile. The data is safe on B's disk.\n• If B's disk is lost forever, it is stuck until an operator\nintervenes.",
			"originalText": "• The partition stays OFFLINE until an ISR member (here B)\ncomes back.\n• Reads and writes fail meanwhile. The data is safe on B's disk.\n• If B's disk is lost forever, it is stuck until an operator\nintervenes.",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"textAlign": "left",
