			"updated": 1795739525669,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "A consumer that was BEHIND (committed offset below 101)\nJust continues and reads the replacement records. It\nnever sees that anything changed.",
			"originalText": "A consumer that was BEHIND (committed offset below 101)\nJust continues and reads the replacement records. It\nnever sees that anything changed.",
