			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "OURS\nNever acknowledge fewer than 2 copies, never\nelect a stale replica. May be unavailable, never\nloses acknowledged data through a single\nfailure.",
			"originalText": "OURS\nNever acknowledge fewer than 2 copies, never\nelect a stale replica. May be unavailable, never\nloses acknowledged data through a single\nfailure.",
