			"text": "Still acknowledges 2 copies. But if both ISR\nmembers are lost and a stale replica is elected,\nearlier acknowledged data is lost. Less likely,\nstill possible.",
			"originalText": "Still acknowledges 2 copies. But if both ISR\nmembers are lost and a stale replica is elected,\nearlier acknowledged data is lost. Less likely,\nstill possible.",
