			"text": "SETTINGS ON THIS CLUSTER\nunclean.leader.election.enable=false · min.insync.replicas=2 · broker.session.timeout.ms=9000 · controlled.shutdown.enable=true ·\nauto.leader.rebalance.enable=true · leader.imbalance.check.interval.seconds=300 · replica.lag.time.max.ms=30000 · KRaft combined mode, 3\nvoters",
			"originalText": "SETTINGS ON THIS CLUSTER\nunclean.leader.election.enable=false · min.insync.replicas=2 · broker.session.timeout.ms=9000 · controlled.shutdown.enable=true ·\nauto.leader.rebalance.enable=true · leader.imbalance.check.interval.seconds=300 · replica.lag.time.max.ms=30000 · KRaft combined mode, 3\nvoters",
