			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "OBSERVED TIMINGS [note 3, one run each]\nFollower docker stop to ISR shrink: about 5 s\nFollower docker kill to ISR shrink: about 9 s\nLeader docker stop to new leader visible: about 17 s\nRestart to ISR back to 3: about 9 to 12 s",
			"originalText": "OBSERVED TIMINGS [note 3, one run each]\nFollower docker stop to ISR shrink: about 5 s\nFollower docker kill to ISR shrink: about 9 s\nLeader docker stop to new leader visible: about 17 s\nRestart to ISR back to 3: about 9 to 12 s",
