			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795739525670,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "• What is elected: the active controller among the KRaft voters\n• Mechanism: Raft. Voters vote, a majority is needed (2 of 3)\n• Scope: one per cluster\n• Needs a quorum: yes, it IS the quorum\n• See it with: kafka-metadata-quorum.sh describe --status\n(LeaderId)",
			"originalText": "• What is elected: the active controller among the KRaft voters\n• Mechanism: Raft. Voters vote, a majority is needed (2 of 3)\n• Scope: one per cluster\n• Needs a quorum: yes, it IS the quorum\n• See it with: kafka-metadata-quorum.sh describe --status\n(LeaderId)",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
