			"updated": 1795739525672,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Time and size are the only rules. Deletion is coarse (whole segments)\nand late (it runs on a schedule), so '24 hours' is not a precise number.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "fa_Jt2ffJjDKGKAHo64jd",
			"originalText": "Time and size are the only rules. Deletion is coarse (whole segments)\nand late (it runs on a schedule), so '24 hours' is not a precise number.",
