			"updated": 1795739525675,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Per-partition lag (ep_consumer_lag)\nTime-lag or ep_event_freshness_seconds\nLog start offset gauge: distance from\nthe committed offset to the log start\nGroup members, rebalances, uptime\nAudit check H (retroactive proof)\nDisk usage per broker\nRecord lag alone is not enough: it does\nnot say how long the data will last",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "e9L9wkpLMAUdJqQxFnUYv",
			"originalText": "Per-partition lag (ep_consumer_lag)\nTime-lag or ep_event_freshness_seconds\nLog start offset gauge: distance from\nthe committed offset to the log start\nGroup members, rebalances, uptime\nAudit check H (retroactive proof)\nDisk usage per broker\nRecord lag alone is not enough: it does\nnot say how long the data will last",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": 1795577829170,
