			"updated": 1795739525676,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "COMMITTED-OFFSET retention\n\nWhat: the group's commits in\n__consumer_offsets\nSetting: offsets.retention.minutes\n(7 days after the group has no members)\nExpiry: group is forgotten, acts like\na new group (uses auto.offset.reset)\nRarely hits first",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "EhBIr_sZ9ogV56EqItLCF",
			"originalText": "COMMITTED-OFFSET retention\n\nWhat: the group's commits in\n__consumer_offsets\nSetting: offsets.retention.minutes\n(7 days after the group has no members)\nExpiry: group is forgotten, acts like\na new group (uses auto.offset.reset)\nRarely hits first",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": 1795577829170,
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null,
