			"updated": 1795739525676,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Sizing: disk per broker ~ rate x retention x RF / brokers (+ headroom)\nIllustration: 2,000 events/s x 600 B = 1.2 MB/s, about 104 GB per day per broker (RF 3, 3 brokers)\nA full disk takes a log dir offline: an availability incident, not only a storage one",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "EZhEWSUYcOPLFBKWk5Lkl",
			"originalText": "Sizing: disk per broker ~ rate x retention x RF / brokers (+ headroom)\nIllustration: 2,000 events/s x 600 B = 1.2 MB/s, about 104 GB per day per broker (RF 3, 3 brokers)\nA full disk takes a log dir offline: an availability incident, not only a storage one",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": 1795577829170,
